flowchart TD
    Start([User Logs In]) --> Choice{Select Activity}
    
    Choice -->|Practice Solo| Browse[Browse Problem Library]
    Browse --> SelectProb[Select Algorithmic Problem]
    SelectProb --> LoadEditor[Load Monaco Editor & Boilerplate]
    LoadEditor --> WriteCode[Write / Edit Solution]
    WriteCode --> RunSample{Run Sample Tests?}
    RunSample -->|Yes| ExecSample[Execute in Local AST Sandbox]
    ExecSample --> ReviewSample[Review Output & Diff]
    ReviewSample --> WriteCode
    RunSample -->|No| SubmitFinal[Submit Solution]
    SubmitFinal --> EvalHidden[Evaluate Against Hidden Test Cases]
    EvalHidden --> CheckAccepted{All Tests Passed?}
    CheckAccepted -->|No| FixCode[Inspect Error Details]
    FixCode --> WriteCode
    CheckAccepted -->|Yes| UpdateStats[Increment Streak & Solved Count]
    UpdateStats --> SaveSub[Persist Accepted Submission Document]

    Choice -->|1v1 Coding Battle| BattleChoice{Host or Join?}
    BattleChoice -->|Host| CreateRoom[Configure Difficulty & Create Room Code]
    CreateRoom --> WaitOpponent[Wait in Lobby for Opponent]
    BattleChoice -->|Join| EnterCode[Enter 6-Character Room Code]
    EnterCode --> JoinLobby[Enter Battle Lobby]
    WaitOpponent --> ReadyCheck[Both Players Signal Ready]
    JoinLobby --> ReadyCheck
    ReadyCheck --> SyncCountdown[Server Initiates Synchronized Countdown]
    SyncCountdown --> BattleLive[Live Coding Duel with Progress Stream]
    BattleLive --> BattleSubmit[Submit Final Duel Code]
    BattleSubmit --> CheckWin{Passed All Tests First?}
    CheckWin -->|Yes| Winner[Declared Match Winner: +100 ELO]
    CheckWin -->|No / Time Out| RunnerUp[Match Concluded: ELO Recalculated]
    Winner --> EndBattle([Return to Dashboard])
    RunnerUp --> EndBattle
    SaveSub --> EndBattle